## The runtime

This game stands on no engine, so the runtime under it is yours to write: the frame
loop and the delta time it measures, the canvas fit, keyboard input, audio cues,
loading the seeded art, and the debug overlay. Where this specification speaks of
the runtime it means that layer, and it states only what Spectra needs from it. How
the layer is structured is yours to decide.
{{else if (eq engine.slug "simple-2d")}}
